 G('Participiais: -ing × particípio × having',['Tipo','Exemplo'],[['-ing (ativo, simultâneo)','**Receiving** the medal, she smiled.'],['particípio passado (passivo)','**Hired** by NASA, she worked on flights.'],['having + particípio (antes)','**Having graduated** at 18, she taught.'],['passivo anterior','**Having been asked**, she checked the numbers.']],'Escolha: **-ing** = ao mesmo tempo; **Having + part.** = antes; **particípio passado** = passivo (*Hired…* = *Because she was hired*). Atenção: o **sujeito** deve ser o mesmo da oração principal.'),
 [('___ in West Virginia in 1918, she showed a gift. (born)','Born','passivo.',None),('___ from college at eighteen, she taught. (graduate, perfect)','Having graduated','antes.',None),('___ by NASA, she worked on flights. (hire, part.)','Hired','passivo.',None),('___ the medal, she smiled. (receive, -ing)','Receiving','simultâneo.',None)],
